<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Síl Muiredaig</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Sil Muiredaig</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Síl Muiredaig were the ruling kindred of Connacht from the 8th century, descended from Muiredach Muillethan, a king of Connacht who died in 702. They included the Ua Conchobair, or O'Connor, kings, among them the high kings Toirdelbach and Ruaidrí Ua Conchobair, as well as the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/macdermot">MacDermots</a> of Moylurg and other Roscommon families.</p></div>
